## 8️⃣ Performance Optimizations

| Technique | How |
|-----------|-----|
| **Image Optimization** | Use Next.js `<Image>` component + `next/image` config. |
| **Code Splitting** | Automatic with Next.js. |
| **Lazy Loading** | `loading="lazy"` on images, dynamic imports (`next/dynamic`). |
| **Prefetching** | `next/link` prefetches automatically. |
| **Caching** | Set proper cache headers on API responses. |
| **Service Worker** | Use Workbox or Next.js PWA plugin. |
| **Minification & Tree Shaking** | Handled by Vercel/Next.js. |
| **Bundle Analysis** | `next-bundle-analyzer`. |
| **Critical CSS** | `next/font` or `styled-components` SSR. |

---

## 9️⃣ Accessibility & SEO

| Item | Implementation |
|------|----------------|
| **Semantic HTML** | Use `<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<footer>`. |
| **ARIA Roles** | Add `role="navigation"`, `aria-label`, etc. |
| **Keyboard Navigation** | Ensure focus states, tab order. |
| **Alt Text** | Provide descriptive `alt` attributes for images. |
| **Meta Tags** | `<Head>` in Next.js pages. |
| **Structured Data** | JSON‑LD for products (`schema.org/Product`). |
| **Canonical URLs** | `<link rel="canonical">`. |
| **Robots.txt & Sitemap** | Generate via `next-sitemap`. |
| **Performance Audits** | Lighthouse, Web Vitals. |

---

## 🔟 Testing Strategy

| Test Type | Tool | Sample Code |
|-----------|------|-------------|
| Unit | Jest + React Testing Library | ```tsx<br/>test('renders product title', () => { render(<ProductCard product={mock} />); expect(screen.getByText(mock.title)).toBeInTheDocument(); });``` |
| Integration | Cypress | `cy.visit('/'); cy.contains('Add to Cart').click();` |
| End‑to‑End | Cypress | `cy.request('POST', '/api/checkout', { items }).then(res => { expect(res.status).to.eq(200); });` |
| Snapshot | Jest | `expect(component).toMatchSnapshot();` |

