## 1️⃣1️⃣ Deployment Pipeline (GitHub Actions + Vercel)

```yaml
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml
name: Deploy

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  build-and-deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: '20'
      - run: npm ci
      - run: npm run build
      - uses: amondnet/vercel-action@v20
        with:
          vercel-token: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}
          vercel-org-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}
          vercel-project-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}
          vercel-args: '--prod'
```

> **Secrets**: `VERCEL_TOKEN`, `VERCEL_ORG_ID`, `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, `AUTH0_*`, `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, etc.

---

## 1️⃣2️⃣ Monitoring & Analytics

| Tool | Purpose | Setup |
|------|---------|-------|
| **Sentry** | Error tracking (frontend + backend) | `npm i @sentry/react @sentry/node` + init in `_app.tsx` and API routes |
| **Google Analytics 4** | Traffic & conversion | Add GA tag in `_document.tsx` |
| **Plausible** | Privacy‑friendly analytics | Add script tag in `_document.tsx` |
| **LogRocket** | Session replay (optional) | `npm i logrocket` + init in `_app.tsx` |

---

